<question-record>
<question>Nel grafico &amp;#x00e8; rappresentato l&apos;andamento della coordinata &amp;#x003C;i&amp;#x003E;q&amp;#x003C;/i&amp;#x003E; dell&apos;immagine di un oggetto, prodotta da uno specchio, in funzione della coordinata &amp;#x003C;i&amp;#x003E;p&amp;#x003C;/i&amp;#x003E; dell&apos;oggetto, rispetto alla posizione dello specchio stesso. 

&amp;#x003C;img src=&quot;0627.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; title=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;180&quot; height=&quot;240&quot; /&amp;#x003E;

Di che tipo di specchio si tratta?</question>
<clue></clue>
<category></category>
<weighting>100</weighting>
<fixed>0</fixed>
<question-type>1</question-type>
<answers>
<answer><text>Specchio sferico concavo</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>Specchio sferico convesso</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>Specchio parabolico</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>Specchio piano</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>1</correct>
<percent-correct>100</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>L&apos;andamento non si adatta a nessun tipo di specchio.</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer></answers>
